<title>POLAND: Rafako plunges as March net loss worsens.</title>
<headline>Rafako plunges as March net loss worsens.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish industrial boilermaker Rafako SA plunged 9.6 percent to 15.1 zlotys on Monday after publishing a March net loss of 6.1 million zlotys on Friday, traders said.</p>
<p>Last March Rafako made a net loss of 1.2 million zlotys.</p>
<p>Sales were down to 22.8 million zlotys this March from 37.7 million last year.</p>
<p>Rafako was the only main market firm on Monday for which selling after price-fixing was strong enough to reduce investors' bids. -- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
